description: "Use the TTS tool"
tags: [login, authentication]
author: "Laurent Eschenauer"
created: "2025-03-31"

Task:
  Navigate to ${HOSTNAME} and verify that you are logged in you see the chatbox.
  Verify that in the bottom of the screen, the tool category selector displays the number 3.
  Open the tool category selector and verify that the Core Tools, the Knowledge Search and the Web Search are checked.
  Select the Speech Tools as an additional tool and close the tool category selector.
  Input the question 'Generate an audio narration about the joy of spring' in the text area and press enter.
  Wait for the result and verify it did generate a mp3 attachement that can be played.
